rust-socksd (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of rusty-socks proxy server
  * Full SOCKS5 protocol implementation with authentication support
  * HTTP proxy functionality with CONNECT method
  * Multi-threaded async architecture using tokio
  * YAML configuration system with validation
  * Systemd service integration
  * Comprehensive security features and logging
  * Debian packaging and Arch AUR support

